# Source / script line endings
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git LFS is intentionally NOT used in this repository.
# Every file under Contents/ is stored byte-for-byte as a regular Git blob:
#   -text        : no CRLF / text normalization (blob == working-tree file)
#   -diff -merge : treat as binary, no textual diff or merge
# This path rule also covers any new asset later added under Contents/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Contents/** -text -diff -merge

# Common asset extensions outside Contents/ are binary too (no LFS filter).
